ople!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1407:b004:l029","ordinal":294090,"en":"Such an interesting big wedding"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1407:b004:l030","ordinal":294091,"en":"Is two better?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1407:b004:l031","ordinal":294092,"en":"He was speechless"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1407:b004:l032","ordinal":294093,"en":"If there are two?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1407:b004:l033","ordinal":294094,"en":"When the blood is drawn"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1407:b004:l034","ordinal":294095,"en":"The old man was angry,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1407:b004:l035","ordinal":294096,"en":"What is the impact of the carnage?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1407:b004:l036","ordinal":294097,"en":"Everyone was angry,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1407:b004:l037","ordinal":294098,"en":"That the decree of blood has come,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1407:b004:l038","ordinal":294099,"en":"\"Don't stay\" - he said, \"he ordered\" -"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1407:b004:l039","ordinal":294100,"en":"Holding the tusks together,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1408:b003:l001","ordinal":294101,"en":"With fangs,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1408:b003:l002","ordinal":294102,"en":"Slap the lower man,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1408:b003:l003","ordinal":294103,"en":"He ducked his neck like a duck,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1408:b003:l004","ordinal":294104,"en":"Humpbacked two humps,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1408:b003:l005","ordinal":294105,"en":"Confused,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1408:b003:l006","ordinal":294106,"en":"When you see it, it makes you happy."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1408:b003:l007","ordinal":294107,"en":"Thinking of revenge,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1408:b003:l008","ordinal":294108,"en":"Let the bald people get a prize,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1408:b003:l009","ordinal":294109,"en":"Fans of Er Kiyaz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1408:b003:l010","ordinal":294110,"en":"Dardan led the thousand,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1408:b003:l011","ordinal":294111,"en":"Work hard and work hard"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1408:b003:l012","